# Code convention

## Restrict

- Never build `useEffect` chains.
- Avoid premature `useMemo` / `useCallback` without need.
- Component file ≤ **200 lines**.
- No Vietnamese identifiers for folders/files/types/vars/functions (UI copy / data OK).
- No magic numbers for business thresholds — use named constants (`src/constants/`).
- No `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` — render multiline text with `white-space: pre-line`.
- No direct DOM manipulation (`querySelector`, `classList`) — drive UI from state.
- No UI barrels (`index.ts` re-exporting components).

## Enforce

- Folders/files `kebab-case`; `PascalCase` components/types; `camelCase` values/hooks.
- Handlers prefixed `handle*`; booleans `is`/`has`/`can`.
- Theme tokens only — see `theme.mdc`.
- `@ant-design/icons` only; no emoji in UI.
- Exhaustive `switch` / `Record<Union, …>` on unions.
- Every `setTimeout` started in a component is cleared on unmount.

## Self-review

- [ ] No effect chaining / derived state in effects
- [ ] English identifiers
- [ ] File ≤ 200 lines
- [ ] Tokens from `src/styles/theme.ts` / `_tokens.scss`
- [ ] `npm run typecheck && npm run typecheck:server && npm test` green
